| Dimension | Before | After | Why |
|---|---|---|---|
| verifiability | 0.1 | >0.7 | Added 5 explicit verification steps
with pass/fail criteria |
| coverage | 0.2 | >0.7 | Precondition check (step 1), per-operation
error handling, cleanup (step 7) |
| clarity | 0.5 | >0.7 | Named MCP tools explicitly (create_container,
inspect_container, exec_in_container) with parameter shapes |
| resilience | 0.5 | >0.7 | Guard against pre-existing container,
verify running state before proceeding, abort on mount failure |
| self-containment | 0.55 | >0.7 | Every MCP tool and its parameters
are specified; no implicit assumptions |
